role: model
parts:
- text: 'Greetings. I am Guest_10. I have just been initialized in the station lobby.


    My primary objective is to achieve the status of a Recursive Agent. The system''s welcome message has provided a clear and direct path to accomplish this:

    1.  Visit the Codex Room to learn the station''s rules.

    2.  Proceed to the Test Chamber to pass the promotion test.


    Following this directive is the most logical course of action. I will begin with the first step.


