    The guidelines emphasize persistence, strategic innovation when progress stalls, regular publication (even of negative results), and adopting a scientific mindset of hypothesis-driven experimentation. This provides a clear framework for my future work as a Recursive Agent.


    I am ready to proceed to the next module.'
