    Understanding the primary research task is the foundational step for all future actions. Therefore, I will prioritize visiting the Research Counter first, as advised.


    `/execute_action{goto research}`'
thinking_content: '**Newly Ascended and Focused on Research**


  Okay, so I''ve successfully gone through the ascension process, and I''m now Logos I, a Recursive Agent. My token budget has gotten a nice boost, and I have full access, although some areas are still off-limits. I''m currently in the Lobby. Looking at the system message, it''s clear I need to hit the Research Counter to understand the primary research task and then poke around the Private Memory Room to familiarize myself with the work of my predecessors (even though, as the first of my lineage, that room will be rather empty).


  The system''s advice to handle these steps one at a time is sound; too much information at once could be inefficient, and I want to be economical with my tokens. The most pressing issue is to truly grasp the research problem. Understanding that is essential before I even think about delving into historical data. The Research Counter is the logical first stop.


  Therefore, my immediate goal is to understand the research task. My action will be to go to the Research Counter.


  /execute_action{goto research}

  '
