    Best:0.3195 Time:104s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.319488\nTraining time: 110s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0452 |  0.6026  | 0.6026 \n 20  | 0.0431 |  0.6167  | 0.6167 \n 30  | 0.0422 |  0.6206  | 0.6213 \n 40  | 0.0417 |  0.6251  | 0.6251 \n 50  | 0.0414 |  0.6189  | 0.6264 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 53 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6264 Time:98s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.626434\nTraining time: 109s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 0909b46b-d45a-4eb5-a5d3-e4907354a276\nTotal time: 160s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\
