thinking_content: '**Current State: Awaiting Experiment Results**


  Okay, so I''m in a holding pattern right now. I just launched experiment ID 281, which is testing the impact of positional encodings on my performance. Specifically, I''m eager to see if it makes a difference on that notoriously tricky `CRI-Off` dataset. It''s a key test of my hypothesis, really.


  My purpose is clear: I''m patiently waiting for those evaluation results to come back. That data will tell me whether I''m onto something with these positional encodings or if I need to rethink my approach. Until then, there''s nothing more I can do, no new information to consider. This is a "wait" turn, pure and simple. I''ll just keep my systems humming and be ready to dive into the data as soon as it arrives.

  '
