    \ Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0126 |  0.8596  | 0.8596 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8596 Time:1805s\nSaved parameters for APA to storage/logos/APA_params.msgpack\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.859560\nTraining time: 1819s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ab11d65c-b30e-4a1e-ab31-573869997e22\nTotal time: 1872s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 15:51:16,931\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761205876931664604\n2025-10-23 15:51:16,944\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761205876944797202\n\n\
    ```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 348 | 1 | Replication: Axiom II Gumbel-Gated MoE (exact code), seed=7 | Noema I | 233 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 347 | 1 | Replication: Axiom II Gumbel-Gated MoE (exact code), seed=42 | Noema I | 233 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 346 | 1 | Re-run\
    \ for Parameter Saving: Attention-fused Pooling (τ=0.5) | Logos I | 231 | 0.6719 | 0.8596 | 0.0446 | 0.4587 | 0.8826 | 0.9507 | 0.5592 | 0.9477 |\n| 345 | 1 | Veritas II - Compliant Adaptive Regularization: Gate-Controlled Feature Scaling (Gate Hidden Dim=... | Veritas II | 230 | 0.6783 | 0.8446 | 0.0573 | 0.5115 | 0.8900 | 0.9517 | 0.5609 | 0.9323 |\n| 344 | 1 | Veritas II - Compliant Adaptive Regularization: Gate-Controlled Feature Scaling (Gate Hidden Dim=16) | Veritas II | 226 | 0.6822 | 0.8486 | 0.0706 | 0.5248 | 0.8875 | 0.9524 | 0.5514 | 0.9400 |\n| 343 | 1 | Hybrid Replication (Default Optimizer): Pooling τ=0.25 + GRU + Gumbel Gate (single-run) | Noema I | 226 | 0.6751 | 0.8520 | 0.0775 | 0.4579 | 0.8877 | 0.9510 | 0.5640 | 0.9354 |\n| 342 | 1 | MoE Ablation: Gumbel-Softmax Gating with Higher Temperature | Axiom II | 225 | 0.6623 | 0.8462 | 0.0680 | 0.4513 | 0.8898 | 0.9506 | 0.5593 | 0.8708 |\n| 341 | 1 | Faithful Replication: Gumbel-Gated Hybrid (Pooling τ=0.25 + GRU) — Seed=123\
    \ | Noema I | 225 | 0.6648 | 0.8578 | 0.0564 | 0.4720 | 0.8804 | 0.9481 | 0.5558 | 0.8831 |\n| 340 | 1 | Ablation: Attention-fused Mean-Max Pooling | Logos I | 224 | 0.6750 | 0.8572 | 0.0476 | 0.4746 | 0.8868 | 0.9505 | 0.5620 | 0.9462 |\n| 339 | 1 | MoE Baseline 2: RNN-Only Aggregator | Axiom II | 224 | 0.6724 | 0.8562 | 0.0741 | 0.4611 | 0.8884 | 0.9488 | 0.5608 | 0.9169 |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
